  "helpAccCreateTitle": "How to create and set up your account",
  "helpAccCreateContent": "To get started on WaveMart:\n\n1. Open the app and tap \"Register\" or \"Sign In\"\n2. Enter your full name, phone number, and a secure password\n3. You will immediately receive a 6-digit SMS verification code (OTP)\n4. Enter the code to verify your phone number and activate your account\n\nOnce registered, you can browse real estate, vehicles, and jobs, save your favorites, unlock seller contact details, or start publishing your own listings.",
  "helpAccFavTitle": "Managing favorites and saved items",
  "helpAccFavContent": "Keep track of listings you are interested in:\n\n1. Tap the heart icon on any property, vehicle, or job card to save it\n2. Access all your saved items anytime from Account > Favorites\n3. Saved items update in real time if prices drop, a property or vehicle is sold or rented, or a job vacancy closes\n4. Tap the heart icon again to remove an item from your favorites\n\nSaving favorites allows you to compare options, monitor market trends, and quickly revisit items without searching again.",
  "helpAccMsgTitle": "In-app messaging and contact reveal",
  "helpAccMsgContent": "WaveMart provides direct channels to connect with sellers, agents, and recruiters:\n\n1. In-App Chat: Tap \"Chat\" on any listing to start an instant, secure conversation without sharing your personal number\n2. Delivery Indicators: Single check mark means sent; double check marks indicate delivered and read\n3. Direct Contact Reveal: Tap \"Reveal Contact\" or \"Call\" to view the verified phone number of the seller or employer (uses 1 view from your monthly subscription quota)\n4. Context Switching: Easily track which property, vehicle, or job each discussion refers to via the chat header\n\nFor your personal safety, always keep discussions, agreements, and payment negotiations within the WaveMart app.",
  "helpListCreateTitle": "How to post properties, vehicles, and jobs",
  "helpListCreateContent": "Publishing your listings on WaveMart is quick and guided:\n\n1. Tap the \"+\" button in the center of the bottom navigation bar\n2. Choose your category: Real Estate (House, Apartment, Commercial, Land for Sale or Rent), Vehicles (Car, Truck, Motorcycle, Machinery for Sale or Rent), or Job Opportunity\n3. Fill in the required specifications (price, area, mileage, employment terms, qualifications, and exact location)\n4. Upload high-resolution photos and document scans (such as Site Plans for properties or vehicle inspection details)\n5. Review your information and tap \"Submit Listing\"\n\nAll listings are verified by our moderation team within 24 hours before going live to ensure quality and authenticity.",
  "helpListManageTitle": "Managing, editing, and renewing listings",
  "helpListManageContent": "You maintain complete control over all your published items:\n\n1. Go to Account > My Listings to view all your property, vehicle, and job posts\n2. Check listing statuses: Pending Approval, Active, Sold, Rented, Filled, or Rejected\n3. Tap any listing to open management controls: Edit details, adjust pricing, or mark as Sold or Closed\n4. Boost Visibility: Apply a Featured or VIP upgrade directly from the listing management screen\n5. Delete or Pause: Remove items that are no longer available or temporarily unpublish them\n\nPlease note: Major modifications (such as changing location or core title) will undergo a quick re-review by our moderation team.",
  "helpListTipsTitle": "Tips for creating high-converting listings",
  "helpListTipsContent": "Attract more serious buyers, renters, and top candidates by following these best practices:\n\n1. High-Quality Visuals: Upload at least 5 clear, well-lit photos showing all angles, interior, exterior, and surrounding area\n2. Transparent Pricing: List realistic, market-competitive prices. State clearly whether the price is fixed or negotiable\n3. Comprehensive Details: For real estate, specify area, water/electricity access, and nearby landmarks. For vehicles, state exact year, mileage, engine, and service history\n4. Clear Job Descriptions: Outline compensation, working hours, required experience, and key responsibilities\n5. Respond Fast: Maintain active engagement in the in-app chat. Fast response times build trust and close deals faster.",
  "helpListVideoTitle": "Video walkthroughs and virtual tours",
  "helpListVideoContent": "Video walkthroughs give buyers and renters a realistic preview before visiting in person:\n\n1. Uploading: When creating or editing a property or vehicle listing, attach a short video tour (up to 60 seconds)\n2. Cloud Processing: Our background video engine automatically compresses and optimizes your clip for smooth streaming across mobile connections\n3. Processing Status: While processing, the listing will show a video preparation badge; once complete, the playable video appears automatically\n4. Verified Video Badge: Listings featuring real video walkthroughs receive higher visibility and customer engagement\n\nViewing video tours is seamless and supported on standard mobile data connections.",
  "helpListInterestTitle": "Expressing interest and contacting sellers",
  "helpListInterestContent": "Connect seamlessly with verified sellers and recruiters:\n\n1. Browse to any property, vehicle, or job detail screen\n2. Direct Contact: Tap \"Reveal Contact\" to instantly view and dial the verified phone number. Each reveal uses one view from your active subscription quota\n3. In-App Chat: Tap \"Chat\" to send inquiries, ask questions, or negotiate terms directly within WaveMart\n4. Job Applications: For job postings, tap \"Apply\" or message the employer directly with your profile\n5. My Interests: View your saved inquiries, conversations, and interaction history anytime from Account > My Interests\n\nDirect contact reveals require an active subscription tier with remaining monthly contact views.",
  "helpListStatusTitle": "Understanding listing statuses and moderation",
  "helpListStatusContent": "Every listing on WaveMart moves through defined verification stages:\n\n- Pending Review: Your submission is being examined by our moderation team for authenticity and image quality (usually within 24 hours)\n- Active: Your listing is live, searchable, and receiving views from buyers across Ethiopia\n- Featured / VIP: Your listing is highlighted with high-priority placement on the homepage and search feeds\n- Sold / Rented / Filled: The property has closed, the vehicle is sold, or the job opening has been filled\n- Rejected: The listing did not meet guidelines (e.g., duplicate post, invalid price, unclear photos). Review the specific feedback, make edits, and resubmit\n- Frozen / Inactive: Temporarily hidden by the owner or administrator\n\nCheck the live status of all your items under Account > My Listings.",
  "helpOrdCreateTitle": "Custom requests for properties, vehicles, and talent",
  "helpOrdCreateContent": "Can't find the exact property, specific vehicle, or skilled professional you need? Create a Custom Request:\n\n1. Navigate to the Requests (Orders) section and tap \"Create Request\"\n2. Choose what you are looking for: Real Estate (buy or rent), Vehicles (make, model, year, budget), or Talent/Hiring requirements\n3. Specify your target budget, desired location, timeline, and exact requirements\n4. Submit your request for automated matching and facilitator assistance\n\nOur system and support team match your request against verified upcoming inventory and alert you the moment a suitable option becomes available.",
  "helpOrdManageTitle": "Managing request proposals and matches",
  "helpOrdManageContent": "When suitable properties, vehicles, or candidate profiles match your request:\n\n1. You will receive an instant notification with full details of the matched proposal\n2. Open your request in the Requests tab to review photos, pricing, and specifications\n3. Tap \"Accept\" to connect directly with the owner, dealer, or applicant\n4. If an offer does not meet your expectations, tap \"Decline\" to keep your request open for further proposals\n5. Close or update your request at any time once your goal has been achieved.",
  "helpPayPlansTitle": "Membership plans, listing limits, and contact quotas",
  "helpPayPlansContent": "WaveMart offers transparent subscription tiers designed for buyers, sellers, brokers, and recruiters:\n\n- Free / Starter: Browse properties, vehicles, and jobs; save favorites; message via in-app chat\n- Basic: Post listings across categories, view video walkthroughs, and receive monthly quotas to reveal seller and job contact details\n- Professional: Higher listing limits, featured visibility boosts, increased contact view quotas, and priority agent support\n- VIP / Enterprise: Unlimited or maximum contact reveals, exclusive access to unlisted VIP properties and luxury vehicles, VIP badge, and premier placement across the platform\n\nContact quotas reset each billing cycle. You can upgrade or renew your plan at any time from the Subscriptions screen.",
  "helpPayMakeTitle": "How to pay using Telebirr, CBEBirr, and Cards via Chapa",
  "helpPayMakeContent": "Upgrading your subscription or boosting listings is instant and secure through Chapa, Ethiopia's premier payment system:\n\n1. Go to Account > Subscriptions and choose your preferred plan\n2. Tap \"Subscribe Now\" or \"Upgrade Plan\"\n3. You will be redirected to the secure Chapa checkout interface\n4. Select your preferred payment method: Telebirr, CBEBirr, M-Pesa, Awash Birr, or any Ethiopian debit/credit card\n5. Follow the quick on-screen prompt to authorize payment on your mobile wallet or banking app\n6. Upon confirmation, your subscription benefits and contact quotas are activated immediately\n\nWaveMart does not charge hidden fees; the price you see is the exact amount charged.",
  "helpPaySecurityTitle": "Payment security and data protection",
  "helpPaySecurityContent": "Your financial security is our highest priority:\n\n1. Bank-Grade Encryption: All payments are processed through Chapa's PCI-DSS compliant, end-to-end encrypted infrastructure\n2. No Card Storage: WaveMart never stores, processes, or has access to your banking passwords, card PINs, or wallet credentials\n3. Instant Receipts: Every successful transaction generates a digital receipt with a unique transaction reference code visible in your account\n4. Transaction Assistance: If a payment completes on your wallet or banking app but is not reflected in your account, contact our support team with your transaction reference for immediate verification.",
  "helpPayVipTitle": "VIP badges and Featured listing boosts",
  "helpPayVipContent": "Maximize views and sell or hire faster with promotional boosts:\n\n- Featured Listing: Positions your property, vehicle, or job post in the high-traffic \"Featured Listings\" banner on the home screen and highlights it in search results for 30 days\n- VIP Listing: Adds an exclusive golden VIP badge, ranks your listing at the very top of buyer feeds, and alerts serious high-intent buyers\n- Unlisted VIP Deals: Subscribers on VIP plans gain access to premium properties and luxury vehicles not visible to standard users\n\nTo promote a listing: Go to Account > My Listings, open the active listing, select \"Boost / Feature\", choose your promotion type, and confirm.",
  "helpKycWhyTitle": "Why identity verification (KYC) is required",
  "helpKycWhyContent": "WaveMart complies with Ethiopian e-commerce safety regulations to protect every member of our community:\n\n1. Preventing Scams & Fraud: Verifying real identities ensures fake accounts, phantom listings, and identity theft cannot operate on WaveMart\n2. Verified Seller Badge: Successfully verified accounts earn a blue checkmark badge, boosting buyer confidence and increasing inquiries\n3. Unlocking Publishing Privileges: KYC verification is required before you can publish properties for sale or rent, list commercial vehicles, or recruit talent\n4. Safe Payments & Contracts: High-value transactions demand trust and accountability on both sides.",
  "helpKycHowTitle": "Step-by-step identity verification guide",
  "helpKycHowContent": "Completing KYC takes less than 2 minutes in the app:\n\n1. Open Account > Verification (KYC)\n2. Choose your document type: Ethiopian National ID (Fayda), Passport, Driver's License, or Kebele ID\n3. Take a sharp, well-lit photo of the front and back of your physical card or document\n4. Take a live selfie using your phone's camera (make sure your face is clearly visible without sunglasses or hats)\n5. Review your legal name and document number, then tap \"Submit Verification\"\n\nOur automated verification system and verification team review submissions within 24 to 48 hours.",
  "helpKycRejectTitle": "Resolving KYC rejection issues",
  "helpKycRejectContent": "If your verification was declined, it is usually due to one of these common issues:\n\n1. Blurry or Glared Photos: Details, letters, or photo IDs are unreadable due to low lighting or camera glare\n2. Expired Document: The identification card or passport submitted is past its expiration date\n3. Mismatched Information: The name entered in your profile does not match the legal name printed on the document\n4. Unclear Selfie: The selfie photo is dark, cropped, or does not clearly match the photo on your official ID\n5. Incomplete Images: Corners or edges of the physical document are cropped out\n\nHow to fix: Go to Verification (KYC), tap \"Resubmit Documents\", retake sharp, well-lit photos of the full document, take a new clear selfie, and submit again.",
  "helpSafePrivacyTitle": "Privacy policy and data protection",
  "helpSafePrivacyContent": "WaveMart strictly respects your personal privacy and safeguards your data:\n\n1. Information We Collect: Basic account profile (name, phone number, email), verified listing specifications, and direct customer support logs\n2. Privacy by Default: Your private phone number and email are concealed on public listings until a verified buyer utilizes a contact reveal\n3. Zero Data Selling: We do not sell, rent, or lease your personal information to advertisers or external marketing brokers\n4. Strict Confidentiality: Documents submitted for KYC verification are stored in secure, encrypted storage and accessed exclusively for compliance verification\n\nRead our full Privacy Policy on our website or reach out to support@wavemart.et for data questions.",
  "helpSafeReportTitle": "Reporting suspicious activity and getting help",
  "helpSafeReportContent": "We take marketplace safety seriously and provide immediate tools to keep your experience secure:\n\n1. In-App Reporting: Tap the three dots (menu) or \"Report\" on any property, vehicle, or job detail screen to flag suspicious pricing, fake images, or improper conduct\n2. Never Send Advance Money: Never wire advance deposits, broker commissions, or booking fees to individuals before physically inspecting the property or vehicle\n3. Emergency Support Line: Reach our dedicated customer safety team directly at +251 981 41 81 81\n4. Email Support: Email support@wavemart.et with screenshots and details; our trust & safety team investigates and responds within 24 hours\n\nTogether, we keep WaveMart the safest marketplace in Ethiopia.",
